{
  "name": "Day 49 Solution: AI Agent Review",
  "description": "Orchestrator workflow that calls another Week 7 workflow via Execute Workflow, captures its output, and branches into success/failure logging based on the result status.",
  "tags": [
    "week-07",
    "ai-agents",
    "day-49",
    "review",
    "orchestrator",
    "solution"
  ],
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "sticky-overview",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        -280
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Day 49 Solution: AI Agent Review\n\nAn orchestrator workflow that calls your most-complete Week 7 workflow via Execute Workflow, captures its output, and branches into a success or failure log based on the result's status field — exactly the pattern described in the Day 49 build steps.\n\n**Credentials needed:** None for the orchestrator itself. Whatever the sub-workflow you point it at needs (commonly an OpenAI API key) still applies when that sub-workflow runs.\n\nSee DAILY_TASKS/DAY_49_AI_Agent_Review.md for the full lesson this solves.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 500
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "manual-trigger",
      "name": "Manual Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "execute-week-7-workflow",
      "name": "Execute Week 7 Workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflow",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        480,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "source": "database",
        "workflowId": "={{ \"REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_WORKFLOW_ID\" }}"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sticky-execute-workflow-note",
      "name": "Execute Workflow Placeholder",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        480,
        560
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚠️ Point this at your own workflow\n\nworkflowId is a placeholder expression. Open this node in n8n and pick your single most-complete Week 7 workflow (e.g. your Day 43-48 solution, imported and given a Webhook or Manual trigger) from the dropdown so Execute Workflow can actually find it — workflow IDs are per-instance and can't be hardcoded ahead of time.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 420
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "capture-sub-workflow-output",
      "name": "Capture Sub-Workflow Output",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        720,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "name": "execution_status",
              "value": "={{ $json.status || 'unknown' }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "execution_result",
              "value": "={{ $json }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "captured_at",
              "value": "={{ $now }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "check-success",
      "name": "Check Success",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        960,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "string": [
            {
              "value1": "={{ $json.execution_status }}",
              "operation": "equal",
              "value2": "success"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "log-success",
      "name": "Log Success",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        1200,
        160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "name": "log_message",
              "value": "✅ Orchestrator run succeeded"
            },
            {
              "name": "workflow_status",
              "value": "success"
            },
            {
              "name": "logged_at",
              "value": "={{ $now }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "log-failure",
      "name": "Log Failure",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        1200,
        440
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "name": "log_message",
              "value": "❌ Orchestrator run failed"
            },
            {
              "name": "workflow_status",
              "value": "failure"
            },
            {
              "name": "error_detail",
              "value": "={{ $json.execution_result.error || 'Unknown error - check sub-workflow output' }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "logged_at",
              "value": "={{ $now }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sticky-week7-status",
      "name": "Week 7 System Status (example note)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        960,
        560
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📝 Week 7 System Status (example)\n\n**What I built:** Seven Week 7 solution workflows (Days 43-48) covering multi-agent orchestration, communication routing, learning, decision making, optimization, and monitoring, plus this Day 49 orchestrator that chains one of them via Execute Workflow.\n\n**Genuinely working end-to-end today:** The webhook triggers, Set-node state/orchestration logic, IF-node branching, and the openAi nodes (with a real OpenAI credential attached) all run and produce real output.\n\n**Still a placeholder:** Every httpRequest node pointed at an api.*-service.com / *-monitor.com / *-engine.com domain — those are fake stand-ins and need a real API (or a mock server) before this is anything more than a teaching demo.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 520
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Manual Trigger": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Execute Week 7 Workflow",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Execute Week 7 Workflow": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Capture Sub-Workflow Output",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Capture Sub-Workflow Output": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Check Success",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Check Success": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Log Success",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "Log Failure",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
